<section><h2>Questions about short-term guarding</h2><dl><dt>Can I request a guard while the whole family is away?</dt><dd>Yes, enquire with the required dates and shifts. Agree access instructions, a nominated contact and reporting arrangements before departure.</dd>
<dt>Can I book only nights while travelling?</dt><dd>Yes, request the specific night-duty hours. State whether anyone else covers the property during the day.</dd>
<dt>Does one guard provide 24-hour home security?</dt><dd>Continuous cover requires a planned roster, breaks and relief. Ask the team to quote for the actual hours you need rather than assuming one guard can work continuously.</dd>
</dl></section>
